@startuml PDF_Document_Upload_Process
title PDF Document Upload Process
actor User
participant "Frontend" as FE
participant "Backend API" as BE
database "Database" as DB
participant "File Storage" as FS
User -> FE: Select PDF file to upload
FE -> BE: POST /upload/file/pdf with PDF file
BE -> BE: Validate file type and size
alt Valid PDF
    BE -> FS: Store PDF file
    FS --> BE: Return file storage path
    BE -> DB: Save document metadata (filename, path, upload time)
    DB --> BE: Confirm metadata saved
    BE --> FE: Return success response with document ID
else Invalid PDF
    BE --> FE: Return error response (invalid file type/size)
end
@enduml